        <div class="title-block animate">
          <h1>National development profiles across seven indicators</h1>
          <p>
            Parallel coordinates encode 30 countries with seven axes. Each polyline is a country, colored by World Bank income group.
            Use hover to inspect outliers and crossings between adjacent dimensions.
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="card legend-card animate delay-1" aria-label="Legend">
          <div class="legend-title">Color = income group</div>
